katemark (0.4.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add teaching callouts: definition, theorem, property, proof, exercise,
    method, remark and solution, also under their French names.
  * Size a picture with {width=50%} after it, as in Pandoc.
  * Scale pasted images down to 1920 pixels wide.
  * Say "Rendering" above the preview while a long document renders.
  * Stop the white flash while a dark preview loads.
  * Keep the PDF margins white when exporting from a dark preview.
  * Leave the page number off a PDF of one page.
  * Windows: ship the translations in the zip.

 -- Olivier Booklage <olivier.booklage@ac-bordeaux.fr>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:15:25 +0000

katemark (0.4.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: raw HTML in a document could run script in the preview. The
    preview now runs the plugin's scripts only.
  * Security: the HTML export embeds pictures from the document's folder
    only.
  * Number the pages of a PDF export, "1 / 3" (Qt 6.10 or later).
  * Add an Open button to the "Preview exported" message.
  * Show a hint in an empty panel.
  * Stop a dark preview from flashing white during an export.
  * Fix a shortcut pressed in the preview acting on a hidden document.
  * Fix links with target="_blank" and middle clicks doing nothing.
  * Follow a change of the editor's color theme.
  * Fix the heading level of selected lines changing the next line too.
  * Fix front matter dates shown with a time, "$" inside \text{}, heading
    anchors with punctuation, and a malformed math macro blanking the
    document.
  * Windows: the Ctrl+Alt shortcuts no longer have a default key.
  * KWidgetsAddons is a new build dependency.

 -- Olivier Booklage <olivier.booklage@ac-bordeaux.fr>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:31:35 +0000

