katemark (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release of Katemark, a fork of Katdown by uwuclxdy.
  * Dock the preview beside the editor and scroll the two together.
  * Read the CodiMD, Obsidian and MkDocs syntax and more markdown-it
    extensions.
  * Render math with KaTeX and diagrams with Mermaid.
  * Export the preview to PDF and HTML.
  * Add Markdown editing actions and image paste.
  * Translate the interface into 44 languages.

